	(text "JFOX-FMU v1 - MCU\nSTM32H753IIT6, LQFP176. 1 MB RAM, 2 MB flash, Cortex-M7 @480 MHz.\n\nPin assignment is generated from the part's own alternate-function\ntable - see PINMAP.md. Not hand-written: the previous board's hand-\nwritten map put five of eight PWM channels on top of SPI1 and SPI2.\n\nVCAP1/VCAP2 are the internal LDO's output. Each needs its own 2.2 uF\nclose to the pin. They are NOT a supply input - do not tie to +3V3."
